{"seq":2,"slug":"recurrence-generating-functions","title":"递推与生成函数","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/combinatorics/recurrence-generating-functions","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"recurrence-relations","title":"递推关系与求解方法","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/combinatorics/recurrence-generating-functions/recurrence-relations","wordCount":2191,"readingTime":9},{"seq":2,"slug":"generating-functions","title":"生成函数基础与技巧","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/combinatorics/recurrence-generating-functions/generating-functions","wordCount":2241,"readingTime":9},{"seq":3,"slug":"catalan-numbers","title":"Catalan 数与经典序列","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/combinatorics/recurrence-generating-functions/catalan-numbers","wordCount":2557,"readingTime":11}],"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"递推与生成函数-简介\">递推与生成函数 简介</h1><p>当直接计数变得困难时，递推关系和生成函数提供了强大的间接计数方法。递推将复杂问题分解为规模更小的子问题，而生成函数则用代数运算统一处理整个计数序列。这些工具在算法分析、概率论和数论中都有广泛应用，是从初等组合过渡到高级组合的关键桥梁。</p>\n<p>本章包含以下三篇文档：</p>\n<p><strong>递推关系与求解方法</strong>介绍如何从组合问题中建立递推方程，系统讲解线性齐次递推和非齐次递推的特征方程法、待定系数法，以及分治递推的主定理，涵盖 Fibonacci 数列、汉诺塔、分割数等经典案例。</p>\n<p><strong>生成函数基础与技巧</strong>以形式幂级数为框架，定义普通生成函数（OGF）和指数生成函数（EGF），演示如何利用乘法、复合、微分等运算从已知生成函数推导新序列的封闭形式，并讨论收敛性与渐近分析的初步方法。</p>\n<p><strong>Catalan 数与经典序列</strong>以 Catalan 数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mi>n</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfrac><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><mfrac linethickness=\"0px\"><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>n</mi></mrow><mi>n</mi></mfrac><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C_n = \\frac{1}{n+1}\\binom{2n}{n}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.2984em;vertical-align:-0.4033em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8451em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.655em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">+</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.394em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.4033em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">(</span></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8951em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.355em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.144em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.345em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">)</span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 为主线，展示递推、生成函数和双射证明三种推导路径，并延伸到 Stirling 数、Bell 数、Motzkin 数等组合序列族，揭示它们之间的递推联系和组合解释。</p>\n<p>学习建议：递推关系的建立需要对问题结构有清晰的认识，建议先通过大量简单例题训练建模能力。生成函数的代数操作类似于微积分中的级数运算，需要一定的形式化计算训练。Catalan 数一节将前两节的方法融合，适合作为综合练习。</p>\n"}